@startgantt gantt
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ganttDiagram {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BarColor #DDE1E8
  BarFontColor #1C2230
  progressColor #4A5163
  milestoneBackgroundColor #E9A23B
  milestoneFontColor #1C2230
  TimelineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  TodayLineColor #C93A31
}

Project starts 2026-09-01
printscale weekly with calendar date
language en

' Project weeks per spec.md §14: week n starts Monday 2026-08-31 + 7(n-1);
' every week (including W14) is a normal Mon-Sun span. The course's final
' deadline (final report & presentation) is Friday 2026-12-04, inside W14 -
' not the week's own end (2026-12-06) - so task/milestone bars below that
' represent deliverables end on 12-04, the deadline date, not on W14's
' calendar boundary.
